- **预期**：forward/backward 样例全部 PASSED
- **实际**：成功，backward `PASSED`；forward 覆盖 causal/no-mask × rab 有/无共 4 组，均 `PASSED`
- **截图**：`screenshots/07_step3_aclnn.png`
